<LegalLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement"
  description="Our commitment to making Davis Weather Station usable by as many people as possible."
>
  <h2>1. Our commitment</h2>
  <p>
    We want everyone to be able to use Davis Weather Station, including people with visual, hearing, motor, cognitive,
    and other disabilities. We aim to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at Level AA as our
    target standard.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Measures we take</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic HTML and logical heading structure.</li>
    <li>Keyboard-accessible navigation, forms, and controls.</li>
    <li>Visible focus states and adequate colour contrast.</li>
    <li>Responsive layouts that work with zoom and small screens.</li>
    <li>Descriptive alternative text for meaningful images.</li>
    <li>Labels and error messages for form fields.</li>
    <li>Reduced reliance on motion; no autoplay audio or video.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Conformance status</h2>
  <p>
    We believe the Site substantially conforms to WCAG 2.2 Level AA, but we have not completed a formal third-party
    audit. Some pages, third-party services, or newly added content may not yet fully conform. We treat accessibility
    as ongoing work.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Known limitations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Bot protection:</strong> the verification widget is provided by a third-party service. Its accessibility features and behaviour are controlled by that provider.</li>
    <li><strong>Third-party content:</strong> reseller websites and external resources are outside our control.</li>
    <li><strong>Product imagery:</strong> some images may contain text or fine detail that is difficult to perceive at small sizes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Feedback and assistance</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter an accessibility barrier, please tell us. Include the page URL, what you were trying to do, and
    the assistive technology or browser you use. We will try to provide the information you need in another format
    and to fix the issue.
  </p>
  <p>
    Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@davisweatherstation.com">contact@davisweatherstation.com</a> or the{' '}
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Assessment approach</h2>
  <p>
    We review accessibility during development using manual checks, keyboard testing, zoom testing, and automated
    tooling. We welcome reports from users who rely on assistive technology.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Date</h2>
  <p>This statement was last reviewed on October 29, 2026.</p>
</LegalLayout>
